{"id":"shiken-vs-funa-bougin","order":1090,"title":{"ja":"四間飛車対舟囲い棒銀：飛車を回って捌く","en":"Fourth File Rook vs Bogin with Funa-gakoi: swing the rook over and trade"},"path":["戦法・定跡","四間飛車"],"intro":{"ja":"後手が舟囲いに組んでから棒銀で攻めてくる戦型です。△７五歩に▲同歩と取ると銀が五段目に出て苦しくなるので、攻められた７筋へ飛車を回るのが定跡です。初手から△７五歩まで組み、角を右へ引いて大駒を交換する四間飛車らしい捌きを、変化も含めて覚えます。","en":"Here Gote castles into Funa-gakoi and then attacks with Bogin. Capturing △7五歩 with ▲同歩 lets the silver reach the fifth rank and Sente suffers, so the book answer is to swing the rook to the attacked seventh file. You will build the position from move one up to △7五歩, then learn the typical Fourth File Rook trade of major pieces, retreating the bishop to the right, including the side lines."},"check":{"question":{"ja":"△７五歩と棒銀の仕掛けを受けたとき、四間飛車は飛車をどの筋へ回りますか。","en":"When the Bogin strike △7五歩 comes, to which file does Fourth File Rook swing the rook?"},"answer":{"ja":"▲７八飛です。７筋を突かれたら、自分の飛車もその筋へ動かして受け止めます。歩を取るのではなく、戦いの起きた場所へ大駒を持っていく考え方です。","en":"▲7八飛. When the seventh file is attacked, the rook moves to that file to meet it. Rather than capturing the pawn, the idea is to bring the major piece to where the fight is."}},"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車 vs 棒銀の定跡② (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2556, All rights reserved)","references":[{"title":"四間飛車 vs 棒銀の定跡②","url":"https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2556","license":"All rights reserved","adapted":false}],"courses":[{"id":"lesson-shiken-vs-funa-bougin-1","title":"四間飛車対舟囲い棒銀：飛車を回って捌く: 基本図から△７五歩まで","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook vs Bogin with Funa-gakoi: swing the rook over and trade: From the basic position to △7五歩","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車 vs 棒銀の定跡② (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2556, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"ついに後手が△７五歩と棒銀を仕掛けてきました。次の一手が勝負の分かれ目です。","root":{"id":"n0","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[