,"sfen":"ln1g1gsnl/1r3k1b1/p1sppp1pp/2p3p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR3K1/LN1G1GSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"4b3b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n16","sfen":"ln1g1gsnl/1r4kb1/p1sppp1pp/2p3p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR3K1/LN1G1GSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3i3h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n17","sfen":"ln1g1gsnl/1r4kb1/p1sppp1pp/2p3p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6a5b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n18","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p1sppp1pp/2p3p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7h6g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n19","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p1sppp1pp/2p3p2/1p7/2PP5/PPBSPPPPP/3R2SK1/LN1G1G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"1c1d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n20","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p1sppp1p1/2p3p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPBSPPPPP/3R2SK1/LN1G1G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"1g1f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n21","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p1sppp1p1/2p3p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPBSPPPP1/3R2SK1/LN1G1G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5c5d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n22","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p1sp1p1p1/2p1p1p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPBSPPPP1/3R2SK1/LN1G1G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6i5h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n23","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p1sp1p1p1/2p1p1p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPBSPPPP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n24","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p2p1p1p1/1sp1p1p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPBSPPPP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5g5f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n25","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p2p1p1p1/1sp1p1p1p/1p7/2PPP3P/PPBS1PPP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7d7e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n26","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1r2g1kb1/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1pp6/2PPP3P/PPBS1PPP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL b - 1","branches":[],"comment":"ついに後手が△７五歩と棒銀を仕掛けてきました。次の一手が勝負の分かれ目です。","commentEn":"At last Gote strikes with △7五歩. The next move decides the game.","figures":[{"id":"1-7","marks":{"last":"7e","boxes":["8d","7f"]}}]}}],"comment":"お互いに端の歩を突きます。端は玉の逃げ道を広げる意味があり、相手が突いたらこちらも突くのが無難です。▲５八金左で囲いの形を整え、▲５六歩は、あとで角を６八から４六へ使うときに動ける範囲を広げる準備です。後手は△８四銀と構えました。","commentEn":"Both sides push the edge pawn. It widens the king's escape route, and a safe habit is to push yours when the opponent does. ▲5八金左 tidies the castle, and ▲5六歩 prepares room for the bishop to go from 6h to 4f later. Gote sets up with △8四銀.","figures":[{"id":"1-6","marks":{"last":"5f","boxes":["8d","5f"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"後手が囲い終えたところで、先手は▲６七銀と銀を上げます。この銀は▲６五歩で飛車と角を同時に動かす狙いを消しますが、代わりに飛車を横へ移せるようになります。四間飛車で最も標準的な銀の位置です。","commentEn":"With Gote's castle finished, Sente raises the silver with ▲6七銀. It removes the idea of ▲6五歩 activating rook and bishop together, but lets the rook move sideways. This is the standard silver position for Fourth File Rook.","figures":[{"id":"1-5","marks":{"last":"6g","boxes":["6g"]}}]}}],"comment":"先手は▲２八玉、▲３八銀と片美濃囲いにします。後手も玉を３二へ運び、△５二金右と固めました。この後手の囲いが舟囲いで、振り飛車と戦うときによく使われます。","commentEn":"Sente makes a Kata Mino with ▲2八玉 and ▲3八銀. Gote also brings the king to 3b and fortifies with △5二金右. That is the Funa-gakoi, a castle often used against Ranging Rook.","figures":[{"id":"1-4","marks":{"last":"3h","boxes":["2h","3h","3b","5b"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"後手は△７三銀から△８四銀へ向けて、８筋の飛車の前に銀と歩を重ねていきます。先手は慌てず、玉を４八、３八と右へ寄せて美濃囲いの準備をします。","commentEn":"Gote heads for △8四銀 and stacks silver and pawn in front of the rook on the eighth file. Sente stays calm and shifts the king to 4h and 3h, preparing the Mino castle.","figures":[{"id":"1-3","marks":{"last":"3h","boxes":["8b","7c"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲６八飛と四間飛車に振り、△８五歩には▲７七角と備えます。▲７八銀で角を支えれば基本形です。相手の飛車先から攻めを受けるのはこの形で、前の講座で見た通りです。","commentEn":"▲6八飛 swings to Fourth File Rook, and after △8五歩 ▲7七角 prepares. ▲7八銀 supports the bishop and completes the basic form. This is the setup that holds the rook-file attack, as seen in the earlier lessons.","figures":[{"id":"1-2","marks":{"last":"7h","boxes":["7g","6h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲７六歩で角道を開けると、後手も△３四歩と角道を開けました。そこで▲６六歩と突いて自分の角道を止め、角交換を避けます。後手は飛車先の歩を伸ばしてきました。","commentEn":"▲7六歩 opens the bishop and Gote answers with △3四歩. Sente then plays ▲6六歩 to block its own bishop line and avoid an exchange. Gote pushes the rook pawn.","figures":[{"id":"1-1","marks":{"last":"6f","boxes":["6f"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"id":"lesson-shiken-vs-funa-bougin-2","title":"四間飛車対舟囲い棒銀：飛車を回って捌く: ▲同歩と取るのは悪い","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook vs Bogin with Funa-gakoi: swing the rook over and trade: Capturing with ▲同歩 is bad","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車 vs 棒銀の定跡② (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2556, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"歩を打って銀に当てても、後手は銀を気にせず△８六歩と突き込みます。▲７五歩と銀を取ると、△８七歩成と成り込まれて先手は大きく負けです。棒銀の思う壺にはまった形です。","root":{"id":"n27","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n28","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n29","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n30","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n31","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n32","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8d8e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n33","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n34","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7a6b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n35","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7i7h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n36","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1