 a very common one in Fourth File Rook.","figures":[{"id":"3-3","marks":{"last":"7b","arrows":["7b7f"]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲７八飛です。戦いの筋に飛車を移す、これが四間飛車の守り方の決まりです。後手が７筋から来たので、先手も７筋で待ち受けます。知らないと思いつきにくい手なので、必ず覚えましょう。","commentEn":"▲7八飛. Moving the rook to the file where the fight is happening is the rule for Fourth File Rook's defence. Gote came on the seventh file, so Sente waits there too. It is hard to find without knowing it, so memorise it.","figures":[{"id":"3-2","marks":{"last":"7h","arrows":["6h7h"]}}]}}],"comment":"もう一度、△７五歩の局面です。正しい受け方を見ていきます。","commentEn":"Again the position after △7五歩. Now the right defence.","figures":[{"id":"3-1","marks":{"last":"7e"}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"id":"lesson-shiken-vs-funa-bougin-4","title":"四間飛車対舟囲い棒銀：飛車を回って捌く: 大駒をぶつけて捌く","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook vs Bogin with Funa-gakoi: swing the rook over and trade: Colliding the major pieces and settling the position","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車 vs 棒銀の定跡② (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2556, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"▲６七銀と銀を引くのが好手です。銀が７筋から離れたので、７八の飛車が後手の飛車に正面からぶつかります。同時に銀が６六の角に当たっています。この二つの当たりから、後手の応じ方を順に見ていきます。","root":{"id":"n90","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n91","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n92","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n93","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/pppppp1pp/6p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n94","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/1p4p2/9/2PP5/PP2PPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id"