G1SK1/LN3G1NL b P2p 1","branches":[{"usi":"7f6g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n123","sfen":"ln3gsnl/2r1g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/3bP3P/PP1S1PPP1/2RBG1SK1/LN3G1NL w P2p 1","branches":[{"usi":"6f9i+","kind":"deviation","child":{"id":"n124","sfen":"ln3gsnl/2r1g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/4P3P/PP1S1PPP1/2RBG1SK1/+bN3G1NL b Pl2p 1","branches":[{"usi":"7h7b+","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n125","sfen":"ln3gsnl/2+R1g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/4P3P/PP1S1PPP1/3BG1SK1/+bN3G1NL w RPl2p 1","branches":[],"comment":"角取りに焦って△９九角成と香を取る手です。▲７二飛成と飛車を取れば、龍ができて先手勝勢です。級位者同士の対局ではこの見落としがよく出ます。","commentEn":"Gote panics about the bishop and takes the lance with △9九角成. ▲7二飛成 captures the rook and makes a dragon, so Sente is winning. This oversight is common between newer players.","figures":[{"id":"4-v1"}]}}]}},{"usi":"P*7g","kind":"deviation","child":{"id":"n126","sfen":"ln3gsnl/2r1g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/3bP3P/PPpS1PPP1/2RBG1SK1/LN3G1NL b Pp 1","branches":[{"usi":"6h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n127","sfen":"ln3gsnl/2r1g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/3bP3P/PPBS1PPP1/2R1G1SK1/LN3G1NL w 2Pp 1","branches":[{"usi":"6f7g+","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n128","sfen":"ln3gsnl/2r1g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/4P3P/PP+bS1PPP1/2R1G1SK1/LN3G1NL b 2Pbp 1","branches":[{"usi":"7h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n129","sfen":"ln3gsnl/2r1g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/4P3P/PPRS1PPP1/4G1SK1/LN3G1NL w B2Pbp 1","branches":[{"usi":"7b7g+","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n130","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/4P3P/PP+rS1PPP1/4G1SK1/LN3G1NL b B2Prbp 1","branches":[{"usi":"8i7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n131","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/4P3P/PPNS1PPP1/4G1SK1/L4G1NL w RB2Prbp 1","branches":[],"comment":"▲７七角△同角成▲同飛△同飛成▲同桂と進み、角と飛車がまとめて交換になりました。この先、先手は▲８二飛と銀と桂を同時に狙う手や、▲６六角と銀と香を狙う手を持っています。美濃囲いが堅い分、先手が有利です。大駒の交換になれば四間飛車の出番です。","commentEn":"▲7七角 △同角成 ▲同飛 △同飛成 ▲同桂 trades both bishops and both rooks together. Sente now holds ▲8二飛 hitting silver and knight, and ▲6六角 hitting silver and lance. With the firmer Mino castle Sente is better. Once major pieces are traded, Fourth File Rook is in its element.","figures":[{"id":"4-v2-1","marks":{"last":"7g","boxes":["8b","6f"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"△７七歩と打つのは「焦点の歩」という手筋です。角と飛車が同時に利く場所に歩を打ち、大駒の働きを乱します。しかし四間飛車には大駒を一気に捌く順があります。","commentEn":"△7七歩 is the tesuji called the focus pawn, a pawn dropped where the opponent's rook and bishop both reach, to disturb them. Fourth File Rook, however, has a sequence that trades the major pieces at a stroke.","figures":[{"id":"4-v2"}]}},{"usi":"7b7h+","kind":"deviation","child":{"id":"n132","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/3bP3P/PP1S1PPP1/2+rBG1SK1/LN3G1NL b Pr2p 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g7h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n133","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/3bP3P/PP3PPP1/2SBG1SK1/LN3G1NL w RPr2p 1","branches":[{"usi":"6f9i+","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n134","sfen":"ln3gsnl/4g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/4P3P/PP3PPP1/2SBG1SK1/+bN3G1NL b RPrl2p 1","branches":[{"usi":"R*8b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n135","sfen":"ln3gsnl/1R2g1k2/p2p1p1p1/1s2p1p1p/1p7/4P3P/PP3PPP1/2SBG1SK1/+bN3G1NL w Prl2p 1","branches":[],"comment":"▲７八銀で龍を取ります。そのあと△９九角成と香を取られますが、▲８二飛と銀桂の両取りに打てば、駒損はすぐに取り返せます。この先は▲７七角と角を交換していく狙いもあります。","commentEn":"▲7八銀 captures the dragon. Gote then takes the lance with △9九角成, but ▲8二飛 forks silver and knight and the lost material is soon regained. Sente can also aim to exchange bishops later with ▲7七角.","figures":[{"id":"4-v3-1","marks":{"last":"8b","arrows":["8b8a","8b8d"]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"△７八飛成と飛車を取ってくる手です。▲７八銀と龍を取るか、▲６六銀と角を取るかの選択ですが、価値の高い飛車を取るのが正解です。","commentEn":"Gote takes the rook with △7八飛成. Sente may recapture the dragon with ▲7八銀 or take the bishop with ▲6六銀, and the correct choice is the more valuable rook.","figures":[{"id":"4-v3"}]}}],"comment":"▲６七銀と銀を引くのが好手です。銀が７筋から離れたので、７八の飛車が後手の飛車に正面からぶつかります。同時に銀が６六の角に当たっています。この二つの当たりから、後手の応じ方を順に見ていきます。","commentEn":"Retreating the silver with ▲6七銀 is the key. With the silver off the seventh file, the rook on 7h meets Gote's rook head on. At the same time the silver attacks the bishop on 6f. Now follow Gote's possible replies in turn.","figures":[{"id":"4-3","marks":{"last":"6g","arrows":["7h7b","6g6f"]}}]}}],"comment":"後手は△６六角と角を出しました。歩を取りながら９九の香にも当てています。▲６八角と引いた形に乗じた手ですが、四間飛車は大駒が前に出てくる形を待っていました。","commentEn":"Gote brings the bishop out with △6六角, taking a pawn and also hitting the lance on 9i. It exploits the retreated bishop, but Fourth File Rook was waiting for a major piece to come forward.","figures":[{"id":"4-2","marks":{"last":"6f","arrows":["6f9i"]}}]}}],"comment":"▲６八角まで進んだ局面です。四間飛車は大駒を交換して捌くのが狙いで、ここから相手の動きに合わせて一気に大駒をぶつけていきます。","commentEn":"The position after ▲6八角. Fourth File Rook aims to settle matters by trading major pieces, and from here it collides them quickly in response to Gote's play.","figures":[{"id":"4-1","marks":{"boxes":["7h","6h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}